{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104290","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110429001:1":{"text":"はぁ、もうすぐ最後の試練が始まるのに、すっごく不安で、全然自信がないよぉ。","source_cn":"唉，最后的试炼马上就要开始了，我这个心，七上八下，真是没底！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x860EB9C9E055C2F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110429002:1":{"text":"オ、オレも筋肉痛で、体力を消耗しすぎた。もう限界だ！","source_cn":"我、我觉得肌肉酸痛，消耗过度，有些无力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC09ABD265F895121","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110429003:1":{"text":"あ～！どこかに飲むだけで体力がつく薬はないかなぁ～？たとえ副作用があっても、全然かまわないのになぁ～！","source_cn":"哎！要是能有什么神奇的药水，喝下去就能增强体力该多好！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4866B31E510A67F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110429004:1":{"text":"だが、こんな見知らぬ土地で、どうやってそんな薬を探せと……？","source_cn":"可是我们初来乍到，去哪里找这样的药水呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C0F623BED9ADB48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1110429004":{"text":"だが、こんな見知らぬ土地で、どうやってそんな薬を探せと……？","source_cn":"可是我们初来乍到，去哪里找这样的药水呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C0F623BED9ADB48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110429005:1":{"text":"マスター、アルサさんとソーンさんの演技が酷いのは予想していましたが……","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8B6DC7B5C773AD7B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、アルサさんとソーンさんの演技が酷いのは予想していましたが……","female":"マスター、アルサさんとソーンさんの演技が酷いのは予想していましたが……","variant_male_record_index":"121121","variant_female_record_index":"121122","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110429006:1":{"text":"もはや絶望的ですよ！あんなの、ロンロンでも騙されませんよ！","source_cn":"竟然会差到这个地步！即使是满满，也不会上当的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDD6276B5023983","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"もはや絶望的ですよ！あんなの、ロンロンでも騙されませんよ！","female":"もはや絶望的ですよ！あんなの、ロンロンでも騙されませんよ！","variant_male_record_index":"121123","variant_female_record_index":"121124","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110429008:0":{"text":"やあやあ、ワイはアクンって言うんやけど、もしや戦歌祭の参加者はん？今、体力増強の薬を探してるとか言わんかった？","source_cn":"哎呀呀，两位是参赛者？阿熏碰巧听了一耳朵！莫非是在寻找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x467D23D860F1186A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110429009:0":{"text":"そうそう！なんでもこの近くでババリアが――むぐっ！","source_cn":"没错没错！听说这附近有个蛮血——唔唔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3CCC74F7687ED62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110429010:0":{"text":"ゴホッゴホンッ！ああ、ぜひともその薬がほしい。どこで手に入るか知ってるのか？","source_cn":"咳咳咳！我们急需那种药，你知道什么地方能搞到吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x476ED6B99CC1B91A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110429011:0":{"text":"うんうん、もちろん知ってるで。そりゃあもう効果は絶大！飲めばあっちゅうまに力が倍増！戦神ブルータス相手でも楽勝や！","source_cn":"唔，那种药我也知道。效果可真是神了！喝下去力量暴涨，面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA227182A7949F9CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110429012:1":{"text":"……本当にそんな効果が？","source_cn":"……效果真的有这么好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x928A20F0CF598D67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110429013:0":{"text":"どや？ほしくなってきたやろ？若い勇士さんほど、こういう薬が必要やもんなぁ！いやぁ、アンタらは運がいいなぁ～","source_cn":"是不是很令人动心？像您这样的年轻勇士，更是需要这种药剂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0B73C3586C5F762","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110429014:1":{"text":"実はちょうど今手元にその薬があるんや！ちーっとばかし値は張るけど、効果はお墨付きやで！二本買えば割引もしたる！","source_cn":"咱们手头就有一些。当然，贵是贵了点……不过绝对物超所值...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46892B6E790286C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110429015:1":{"text":"チチッチチチッ！","source_cn":"吱吱叽叽叽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C1D4B240715EEFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110429016:1":{"text":"そんなに高いの？うーん、ならいいや。うちは――","source_cn":"很贵吗？还是算了吧，我们的氏族……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DC83FB01420380C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110429017:1":{"text":"ちょい待ち、勇士さん！これはな、よそでは絶対手に入らんワイの特製レシピなんや！","source_cn":"留步，勇士！我保证别人家没有这样的药，这是我阿熏的独家配方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73E9DE42E600C73C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1110429018:1":{"text":"つまり、あんたからしか買えないってことか？","source_cn":"你是说，这附近只有你在卖药？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163132A5636CA689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1110429019:1":{"text":"せや！こう見えても、調合の腕に関しては、荒涼の砂漠でワイの右に出るもんはおらんで！","source_cn":"没错！别看我这样，配药的手艺可是荒角沙漠独一份！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA608E1F995F5AD18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1110429020:1":{"text":"そうか、このあたりでドーピング薬を売ってるのはあんただな。来い、マンカラがあんたを探してる。","source_cn":"果然你就是那个活动在附近的非法药贩。走吧，曼卡拉有事找你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84B58623039B668E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1110429021:1":{"text":"アクンって言ったかしら？ちょっとあたしとお喋りしましょ！","source_cn":"阿熏是吧？站住，跟曼卡拉聊聊吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE56F9B2AE4E9EAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1110429022:1":{"text":"んなっ！ワイを捕まえに来たんか！ほな、失礼！","source_cn":"啊啊！是来抓我的吗！我……先走一步！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB5C9A00FA2312A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"……シュールだな。","source_cn":"……太好笑了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x765D139E20888525","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"……シュールだな。","female":"……シュールね。","variant_male_record_index":"63224","variant_female_record_index":"63225","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1110429007:1":{"text":"あ、あたしもここまで酷いとは思わなかったのよ！うーん……さすがに無茶だったかしら？","source_cn":"这……曼卡拉也没想到效果这么惨烈！果然我是有点强人所难了吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD5F0025FDBAA47AF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あ、あたしもここまで酷いとは思わなかったのよ！うーん……さすがに無茶だったかしら？","female":"あ、あたしもここまで酷いとは思わなかったのよ！うーん……さすがに無茶だったかしら？","variant_male_record_index":"121125","variant_female_record_index":"121126","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"マンカラ、どう思う？","source_cn":"曼卡拉，评价一下表现","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x166A61681A39A378","va